OL,3,GNEWSAUnidentified WWI soldier buried
OL,4,Awith full honours
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unidentified soldier who served in
OL,7,Fthe West Yorkshire Regiment during
OL,8,FWorld War One has been buried more than
OL,9,Fa century after his death.
OL,11,FThe man's remains were discovered last
OL,12,Fwinter to the south of the Thiepval
OL,13,FMemorial on the Somme in France.
OL,15,FAccording to the Ministry of Defence
OL,16,F(MoD), his identity has never been
OL,17,Fconfirmed, but a shoulder title and
OL,18,Fbelt found near the remains indicated
OL,19,Fhe served with the West Yorkshire
OL,20,FRegiment.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
