OL,3,GNEWSAUnidentified WWI soldier buried
OL,4,Awith full honours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MoD said he was buried with full
OL,7,Fmilitary honours at the Commonwealth
OL,8,FWar Graves Commission's Serre Road
OL,9,FCemetery Number Two in France on
OL,10,FWednesday.
